## Power Automate
  

|||||
|:---|:---|:---|:---|
|Flow Name|Description|Triggers|Actions|
|When a new response is submitted|Automates the processing of new Microsoft Forms responses by retrieving response details, extracting relevant information, and sending the data to a specified Copilot for further processing.|<ul style='padding-left: 16px; margin: 0;'><li>When a new response is submitted (Microsoft Forms)</li></ul>|<ul style='padding-left: 16px; margin: 0;'><li>Initialize variable (FormDetails)</li><li>For each response</li><li>Get response details (Microsoft Forms)</li><li>Set variable (FormDetails)</li><li>Send prompt to specified Copilot for processing</li></ul>|
|Assign Approved Users to Licensing Group|Automates the assignment of approved users to a licensing group by validating user information, checking group membership, adding users if not present, and notifying them via email upon successful license assignment.|<ul style='padding-left: 16px; margin: 0;'><li>When a row is added, modified, or deleted in 'mshls_licensingrequest' entity with specific approval attributes</li></ul>|<ul style='padding-left: 16px; margin: 0;'><li>Initialize variable for User Id</li><li>Validate Object ID of User</li><li>Get user profile</li><li>Set variable for User Id</li><li>Get group members</li><li>Filter array to check if user is in group</li><li>Add user to group if not already present</li><li>Send an email notification to user</li></ul>|
|When a new email arrives|Processes incoming emails with the subject 'LA Demo', retrieves user profile details from Microsoft Graph, and initiates a license request via Copilot.|<ul style='padding-left: 16px; margin: 0;'><li>When a new email arrives (V3) with subject filter 'LA Demo'</li></ul>|<ul style='padding-left: 16px; margin: 0;'><li>Initialize variable 'UserDetails'</li><li>For each email, send an HTTP request to Microsoft Graph to get user profile details</li><li>Set variable 'UserDetails' with retrieved profile data</li><li>Send a prompt to Copilot for processing and initiate a new license request</li></ul>|
|Manager Approval Workflow|Automates the approval process for licensing requests by triggering on changes to licensing request records, retrieving the manager, initiating an approval workflow, and updating the request status based on the manager's decision.|<ul style='padding-left: 16px; margin: 0;'><li>When a row is added, modified or deleted in 'mshls_licensingrequest'</li></ul>|<ul style='padding-left: 16px; margin: 0;'><li>Get manager information using Office 365 Users</li><li>Start and wait for manager approval</li><li>Update licensing request record with approval outcome and manager email</li></ul>|
|Validate Licensing Details|Automates the validation of user licensing requests by parsing input data, retrieving license friendly names, categorizing known and unknown licenses, and using AI to provide recommendations and rationale for license assignment.|<ul style='padding-left: 16px; margin: 0;'><li>Manual HTTP request with SkuIds, User Attributes, User Justification, and Original User Request</li></ul>|<ul style='padding-left: 16px; margin: 0;'><li>Parse JSON input for SkuIds</li><li>Retrieve friendly names of licenses using AI Builder</li><li>Query and separate known licenses</li><li>Query and separate unknown licenses</li><li>Invoke AI Builder for licensing reasoning and recommendations</li><li>Respond to the agent with license details, unknown license count, AI confidence score, rationale, recommended action, and group ID</li></ul>|
|When a row is modified|Initiates an automated process when a row in the 'mshls\_licensingrequest' entity is added, modified, or deleted, and sends a prompt to a specified Copilot agent to generate and email a response to the requester regarding the final outcome of a licensing request.|<ul style='padding-left: 16px; margin: 0;'><li>When a row is added, modified or deleted in 'mshls_licensingrequest' (filtered by 'mshls_procurementapproved')</li></ul>|<ul style='padding-left: 16px; margin: 0;'><li>Send a prompt to the specified Copilot for processing and email the requester with the final outcome</li></ul>|
|Get Procurement Approval|Automates the procurement approval process for licensing requests by triggering on changes to licensing request records, retrieving user profiles, initiating approval workflows, and updating request statuses based on approval outcomes.|<ul style='padding-left: 16px; margin: 0;'><li>When a row is added, modified, or deleted in the licensing request entity with manager approval</li></ul>|<ul style='padding-left: 16px; margin: 0;'><li>Get user profile</li><li>Start and wait for an approval</li><li>Update licensing request record with procurement approval and request status</li></ul>|

